  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Civil Society Roadmap Facility</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;To assist with technical support EU HQ and a number of EU DEL on engagement with civil society, including the revision, implementation, monitoring and evaluation, of their EU and Member States Country Roadmap for engagement with Civil Society Organisations (CSOs). The support can consist of technical and methodological guidance on the Roadmap (RM) development and implementation, and/or facilitating communication and exchange of experiences between EUD.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
